# The battles' monsters: the ones a Super Famicom Dragon Quest draws too, each in the NES drawing's place.
# Dragon Quest III and V draw these creatures as the NES game does (the same designs, the same poses, nearly the
# same sizes); every monster that shares the NES drawing's tiles and differs in colour takes the same picture.
# "tones nes": each in the colours the NES game gives that monster (pack.py), so the variants the Super Famicom
# games never drew, and the ones they colour otherwise (Esturk is brown there), are Dragon Warrior IV's.
# No Super Famicom game draws the other 55 drawings (148 monsters): they stay as the NES draws them.

figs dq3m ../../../generated/sfc/dq3_monsters.figs
figs dq5m ../../../generated/sfc/dq5_monsters.figs
monsters nesm ../../../generated/sfc/nes_monsters.json

# the slimes (Dragon Quest III)
mon 00 dq3m:4c982130 tones nes # Slime
mon 04 dq3m:4c982130 tones nes # Slime (the eight that join)
